  "failure_conditions": [
    "A near side, removal, gluing line and far side where attaching an intact receiving side (a census knot space split at a point, standing in for a line of the near side) changes the new knots of up to three points that avoid the side, or gives a new knot through the side where the closed space has none.",
    "A one-point hidden gadget whose exclusion sets are subcubes of the six port patterns but which changes creation, or one whose exclusion sets are not subcubes and which never changes it on the stated bases.",
    "A pendant line (one new point on one new line through two near points) that changes creation.",
    "A step of the proof of the proved half that fails on an instance."
